        <mxCell id="tier2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" value="&lt;b&gt;LAPISAN INTI AGEN AI &amp;amp; MESIN DETERMINISTIK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Python 3.12 • FastAPI (Asinkron) • Pydantic v2 • Mesin Kriptografi • aiomysql&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border: 0.5px solid #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Sanitasi &amp;amp; Keamanan:&lt;/b&gt; Pembersih Data Pribadi (PII) &amp;amp; Detektor Eksploit Teks Putih Tersembunyi PDF&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Privasi Kriptografis:&lt;/b&gt; Enkripsi Amplop AES-256-GCM (DEK/KEK) + Indeks Buta SHA-256 (Pencarian Email)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Jalur Investigasi 7 Tahap:&lt;/b&gt; [Pahami] → [Anonimkan PII] → [Investigasi Klaim] → [Lacak Bukti] → [Kalkulasi Skor Matematis Deterministik 4D] → [Sintesis Ujian Adaptif] → [Reservasi Slot Atomik]&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Pemulihan Mandiri Terbatas:&lt;/b&gt; Percobaan Ulang Otomatis (≤3 kali) &amp;amp; Resolusi Bentrok Kalender Dinamis (HTTP 409)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Lingkungan Server:&lt;/b&gt; VPS Ubuntu, Nginx Reverse Proxy (Sertifikat SSL Let&#39;s Encrypt, Protokol HTTP/2)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
