        <mxCell id="tier3_left" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=8;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" value="&lt;b&gt;GERBANG INFERENSI KECERDASAN BUATAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Gerbang API 9Router (Port Lokal 20128)&lt;br&gt;Model Fondasi: Gemini 3.8 / 3.7 Flash&lt;/font&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border: 0.5px solid #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;div align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;padding: 2px 8px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;• Validasi Ketat Format Skema JSON (Pydantic)&lt;br&gt;• Pemeriksaan Silang Konsensus Dua Model&lt;br&gt;• Nol Halusinasi Aritmatika (Larangan Hitung LLM)&lt;br&gt;• Inferensi Deterministik (Suhu: 0.2)&lt;br&gt;• Penyaring Sanitasi Muatan Teks Waktu-Nyata&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
